  "description": "Buckley Real Estate are delighted to launch this beautiful 1 bedroom apartment to the rental market. This stunning property has been recently refurbished to a very high standard and are coming fresh to the market, having never been lived in. Situated in a highly sought after, central area, of Fairview, these properties are ideal for anyone wishing to be close to the heart of the city centre whilst living in a residential borough. The apartment therefore come with all the benefits of living in such an established location with the area containing a host of shops, bars, restaurants and cafes all at your door step, There is also an abundance of public transport available. The apartment is bright and spacious and fitted with all mod cons. The property have been fully furnished to the highest possible standard. Early viewing is essential to appreciate all these stunning properties have to offer and available by appointment exclusively through Buckley Real Estate.",
